                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Most Awarded Composers</h2>
            <p>John Williams stands as the dominant figure in Oscar scoring history with {composer_wins.iloc[0]} wins, followed by John Barry with {composer_wins.iloc[1]} wins. The ranking reveals a mix of repeat winners who shaped entire eras and first-time winners who broke through once.</p>

            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="topComposersChart"></canvas>
