                    <h4>Modern Era (1980–1999)</h4>
                    <p>John Williams dominated with iconic scores for Star Wars and E.T., but the era also saw Hans Zimmer begin his rise and Alan Menken's Disney renaissance. The diversity index peaked in the 1990s, reflecting the Academy's broadening taste.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="era-card">
